WEBVTT

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.513
Thermal Queue Governor
Recorded interactive walkthrough · synthetic motor data

00:00:02.513 --> 00:00:07.867
1 · Explore the motor
Click the windings to see what they do and how effort produces heat.

00:00:07.867 --> 00:00:14.636
2 · Inspect the drive electronics
The controller, inverter, capacitor, and sensors are clickable schematic parts.

00:00:14.636 --> 00:00:25.497
3 · A clipped sensor can hide a hotter motor
The reading stops at 95°C; the governor keeps an upper temperature bound.

00:00:25.497 --> 00:00:37.198
4 · Accepted commands still have to execute
The governor accounts for all eight queued commands before admitting more effort.

00:00:37.198 --> 00:00:45.084
5 · Compare the optional waiting scheduler
This demo mode waits for full effort and rejects requests after 20 simulated seconds.

00:00:45.084 --> 00:00:49.546
6 · Review the measured simulation results
Effort delivered, completed and rejected commands, and over-limit samples update from the run.

00:00:49.546 --> 00:00:51.580
Explore it yourself
Same scalar governor · detailed hardware illustration · no physical motor or electrical circuit test
